<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - Units seen hitting Amic yr profit.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Units seen hitting Amic yr profit.</headline>
<byline>Melanie Cheary</byline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Disappointing performances by steel, engineering and paper divisions are likely to depress Anglo American Industrial Corp's year profit, in line with its earlier disheartening forecast, analysts said on Friday.</p>
